ADDENDUM <Supreme Court Rule No. 1198, March 2, 1992>

(1) These Rules shall enter into force on the date of their promulgation.

(2) The following Rules are hereby repealed, respectively:
1. Rules on Granting Writs of Execution on Press Arbitration Settlement Records, etc. (Supreme Court Rule No. 1027);
2. Rules on Granting Writs of Execution on Mediation Documents of the Consumer Dispute Mediation Committee (Supreme Court Rule No. 1049);
3. Rules on Granting Writs of Execution on Mediation Records of the Medical Review and Mediation Committee (Supreme Court Rule No. 1050);
4. Rules on Granting Writs of Execution on Mediation Records of the Copyright Deliberation Committee (Supreme Court Rule No. 1051);
5. Rules on Granting Writs of Execution on Mediation Records of the Marine Pollution Dispute Mediation Committee (Supreme Court Rule No. 1052);
6. Rules on Granting Writs of Execution on Mediation Records of the Environmental Dispute Mediation Committee (Supreme Court Rule No. 1053).
